{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260616_214608_p15_b24", "persona_id": "db:15", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "1. 线下店场景严禁使用“您先随便看看”等让客户自行浏览的话术，必须主动邀请客户上手体验或进行真机演示。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260616_215133"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260616_214608_p15_b24", "persona_id": "db:15", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "2. 客户要求具体参数（如亮度尼特数、续航实测条件）时，必须给出精确数字或现场演示，不能回避或重复模糊回答。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260616_215133"}
