{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260616_214608_p15_b24", "persona_id": "db:15", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "5. 客户威胁转向竞品时，应立刻采取行动（如邀请对比体验），而非继续无效话术。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260616_215133"}
